<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 222,367.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 222,367.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of April 18 totaled 222,367 bales, up from 221,862 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 619 bales issued, 1,435 decertification orders, 114 cancellations, and no bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
